---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Rodents in Attic Victoria TX | Mice & Rat Removal" description="Hearing scratching in the attic in Victoria, TX? We remove mice and rats and seal the entry points they use.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Rodents in Attic</div>
      <h1>Rodents in the Attic</h1>
      <p>Scratching at night, droppings or chewed insulation are clear signs. We remove them and close the way in.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why Attics Attract Rodents</h2>
      <p>Attics offer warmth, nesting material and protection. Mice and rats enter through gaps at eaves, vents, roof intersections and utility penetrations. Once inside they can damage wiring and insulation.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Rodent Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
